        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "James Lyons O'Keeffe estate agents are delighted to present this exceptional coastal property in Durod, Goleen, enjoying spectacular panoramic views across Dunmanus Bay towards Ahakista, Castletownbere and the Kerry Mountains.\r\nCompletely renovated and finished to an outstanding standard, this exquisite three-bedroom modern residence has been thoughtfully designed to make the most of its extraordinary coastal setting. Contemporary interiors, high-quality finishes and generous living spaces combine to create a home that is both stylish and inviting.\r\nHere, the landscape takes centre stage. Expansive coastal views provide a stunning backdrop throughout the property, while the peaceful surroundings offer a wonderful sense of privacy and escape.\r\nA truly special West Cork home, offering the opportunity to enjoy modern luxury surrounded by the raw beauty of the Atlantic coastline.\r\n\r\nFeatures: \r\nA Rated 3 bedroom residence \r\nTop quality finish throughout \r\nAir source heat pump with under floor heating \r\nKube kitchen \r\nBrand new fittings and appliances throughout. \r\nWalled entrance with electric gates\r\nTar & chip drive and parking area. \r\nGardens recently planted and landscaped. \r\nStorage shed. \r\nSolar.\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
